---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro'
import PhotoPlaceholder from '../components/PhotoPlaceholder.astro'

const title = 'About — Pin High Media'
const description = 'Pin High Media is a specialist software studio for the UK golf industry, building tools designed around how clubs, county unions, and tour organisers actually work.'
---

<Layout title={title} description={description}>

  <section class="ph-page-head">
    <div class="ph-container">
      <h1 class="ph-page-h1">I'm Kevin. I'm a golfer, and I build software for golf clubs and counties.</h1>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="ph-about-body">
    <div class="ph-container ph-about-grid">
      <div class="ph-about-prose">
        <p>
          It started with Durham County Golf Union — automating an administration process that was taking the County Secretary and his team months every year. The new system reduced it to a single button press.
        </p>
        <p>
          That was enough to convince me there was a real need here.
        </p>
        <p>
          I'm a member at Wearside Golf Club. I looked at how they were doing things and built them something better. Then Durham County's website. Then CountyConsent. Then ClubSentinel. Each one came from seeing a real problem and knowing I could fix it.
        </p>
        <p>
          Golf administration is full of problems that software can solve. Most clubs and counties are doing things the hard way — not because they want to, but because nobody's built them a better option yet.
        </p>
        <p>
          This site is a gallery of what I've built so far. If something here looks like it solves a problem you have, get in touch.
        </p>
        <p style="font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 20px; letter-spacing: -0.01em; color: var(--ink-2);">— Kevin</p>

        <div style="margin-top: 8px;">
          <a href="/contact" class="ph-btn ph-btn-primary" style="display:inline-flex;">
            Get in touch
            <svg viewBox="0 0 12 12" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2 6h8m-3-3 3 3-3 3"/></svg>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <aside class="ph-about-side">
        <PhotoPlaceholder kind="portrait" ratio="3/4" label="Kevin Jager" />
        <div class="ph-about-card">
          <div class="ph-about-card-name">Kevin Jager</div>
          <div class="ph-about-card-role">Founder &amp; principal engineer</div>
          <p class="ph-about-card-bio">Golfer. Software engineer. Member at Wearside GC. Building tools for clubs that deserve better than the off-the-shelf alternatives.</p>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="ph-closing">
    <div class="ph-closing-inner">
      <h2 class="ph-closing-h">Software that understands golf.</h2>
      <p class="ph-closing-p">
        Tell us what your club, county, or tour is wrestling with — we probably know the problem already.
      </p>
      <div class="ph-hero-ctas ph-closing-ctas">
        <a href="/contact" class="ph-btn ph-btn-primary">
          Get in touch
          <svg viewBox="0 0 12 12" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2 6h8m-3-3 3 3-3 3"/></svg>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</Layout>
